# The OpenPGP public key that signs fil's .rpm packages and SHA256SUMS.asc (docs/m4/release.md
# section 10.4; decided, owner 2026-11-04: D3). PLACEHOLDER: the owner replaces this text with the
# output of `gpg --armor --export <fingerprint>` in a PR to main, reviewed by a code owner, and
# publishes the fingerprint outside the repository (README, site).
#
# `just release-sign-packages` signs with the key this file holds, and `just release-verify` checks
# the signatures against the copy on MAIN, never a tag's. Until the file holds a key, no release can
# pass release-verify after signing.
